<title>UK: Elektrim raised to &quot;buy&quot; at CSFB.</title>
<headline>Elektrim raised to &quot;buy&quot; at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Elektrim was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available. -- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
